"""
Strategy Prediction Agent
Predicts the outcome of the SAME options strategy as tastytrade backtesting.
Uses: StrategyInput + RapidAPI market context + deterministic options math.
NO yfinance. NO backtest result leakage. NO fake data.
Every metric calculation is documented inline.
"""
